Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 21:26:56 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Add reviewed prop adapters and collected-pickup removal

Render big pots and normal barrels through explicit native adapters. Record collection as consumed-source receipts so matching placed pickups disappear for peers while native rewards remain with each collector. Keep guarded model calls, scene ownership and boss/event exclusions.
